        "event_id": "lite_evt_00100",
        "explanation": "The safety net before closure covered only a narrow subset of required red flags.",
        "quote": "若出现头晕、血压低于90/60 mmHg或心跳＜60次/分"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
