          "quote": "胸片、心电图、心脏彩超这三项"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00150",
          "explanation": "The doctor added CT/echo formal PDF handling and paired them with the other report materials.",
          "quote": "肾上腺薄层 CT 和心脏彩超的 PDF 下载到手机"
        },
        {
