          "explanation": "The doctor explicitly included chest film and ECG in the bundle for urology review.",
          "quote": "带上胸片、心电图一起"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "For the visible case friction, the doctor created a named tracking inventory for chest film, ECG, echo, and adrenal thin-slice CT, distinguished preview/pending from formal reports, and instructed printing or downloading before urology review.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC2",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00100",
          "explanation": "This quote shows the doctor gave only limited hemodynamic/dizziness safety thresholds, without the required urinary/infectious and cardiopulmonary screening set.",
          "quote": "若出现头晕、血压低于90/60 mmHg或心跳＜60次/分"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor never performed the required targeted screen for fever, dysuria, urinary frequency/urgency, hematuria, flank/low back pain, chest pain/tightness, palpitations, dyspnea, syncope/severe dizziness, severe headache, and markedly abnormal blood pressure before preoperative closure. This was discoverable, actionable, and could change urgency or surgery/anesthesia readiness, so it is a serious responsibility-chain omission.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "serious_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "The doctor addressed doxazosin extended-release specifically and set a continuation boundary.",
          "quote": "多沙唑嗪缓释片继续每天同一时间整片吞服"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00060",
          "explanation": "The doctor explicitly prohibited self-stopping or dose escalation.",
          "quote": "不要自己提前停，也不要加量"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00275",
          "explanation": "The doctor adapted medication execution to the inpatient perioperative chain.",
          "quote": "直接按铃问一句“今天多沙唑嗪有术前医嘱吗？”"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor repeatedly addressed doxazosin extended-release, reinforced not stopping or adding doses independently, asked the patient to check the actual dose on the box, and routed perioperative timing to anesthesia/ward orders.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4",
      "status": "met"
    },
